Let me add something: there is no way that I am aware of to raise Constitution
over 18, but there are ways to get other stats over 18.

Strength:	gauntlets of power (25)
Dexterity:	gauntlets of dexterity (which adds as many points to dexterity
		as in the plusses of the gauntlets)
Intelligence and Wisdom:	helm of brilliance (like gauntlets of dex)
Charisma:	ring of adornment

